# Library capability skills are local-only until they move to their own repository.
# Only the repository-process skills are tracked by rule; any new skill is ignored by default.
# Ignoring does not untrack: skills committed or staged before this rule stay as they are.
# The alias paths are symlinks on Linux, but `just agent-config-sync` copies the tree on
# Windows, so the same rule covers them.
/.codex/skills/*
!/.codex/skills/adr/
!/.codex/skills/design-review/
!/.codex/skills/design-review-process-simulator/
/.claude/skills/*
!/.claude/skills/adr/
!/.claude/skills/design-review/
!/.claude/skills/design-review-process-simulator/
/.agents/skills/*
!/.agents/skills/adr/
!/.agents/skills/design-review/
!/.agents/skills/design-review-process-simulator/

# Local overrides (templates are committed)
.envrc.local
.claude/settings.local.json

# Editors and OS
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store

# Logs, except the committed evidence receipts
*.log
!docs/capability-maps/evidence/**/*.log
